  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development is proposed to be built over and in close proximity to a&amp;nbsp;culvert and an appropriate buffer zone would not be provided. Notwithstanding this, the applicant has not provided any information to demonstrate how the existing culvert would be protected during construction works to ensure it would not be damaged and result in flooding within the application site and elsewhere.&amp;nbsp;The proposed development is therefore contrary to The National Planning Policy Framework (2023), policy SI12 and SI13 of The London Plan (2021), policy CS.1.U of The Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and policies DM9, DM10 and DM11 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
